<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Float, Position & Media Query</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #333;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #0066cc;
            margin-top: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #0066cc;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        h3 {
            color: #333;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }


        /* ===== FLOAT ===== */
        .box {
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: #fafafa;
        }

        .float-left {
            float: left;
            width: 30%;
            background: #0066cc;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-right: 15px;
        }

        .float-right {
            float: right;
            width: 30%;
            background: #009900;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-left: 15px;
        }

        .clear {
            clear: both;
        }

        /* ===== POSITION ===== */
        .position-demo {
            height: 150px;
            background: #f0f0f0;
            margin: 20px 0;
            position: relative;
        }

        .pos-box {
            width: 100px;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .pos-static {
            position: static;
            background: #0066cc;
        }

        .pos-relative {
            position: relative;
            top: 20px;
            left: 30px;
            background: #009900;
        }

        .pos-absolute {
            position: absolute;
            top: 30px;
            right: 20px;
            background: #ff6600;
        }

        .pos-fixed {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            background: #cc0000;
            width: 100px;
            padding: 10px;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        /* ===== MEDIA QUERIES ===== */
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .item {
            background: #0066cc;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .float-left,
            .float-right {
                float: none;
                width: 100%;
                margin: 10px 0;
            }

            .pos-fixed {
                display: none;
            }

            .container {
                padding: 15px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .container {
                padding: 10px;
            }
        }

        code {
            background: #efefef;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-family: monospace;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Float, Position & Media Query</h1>

        <!-- FLOAT SECTION -->
        <h2>1. FLOAT</h2>
        <p>Float removes an element from normal flow and allows other content to wrap around it.</p>

        <h3>Float Left Example:</h3>
        <div class="box">
            <div class="float-left">Floated Left</div>
            <p>This text wraps around the floated box on the left.</p>
            <div class="clear"></div> 
        </div>

        <h3>Float Right Example:</h3>
        <div class="box">
            <div class="float-right">Floated Right</div>
            <p>This text wraps around the floated box on the right.</p>
            <div class="clear"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- POSITION SECTION -->
        <h2>2. POSITION</h2>
        <p>Position determines how an element is placed in the document flow.</p>

        <h3>Position Static (Default):</h3>
        <div class="position-demo">
            <div class="pos-box pos-static">Static</div>
        </div>

        <div class="position-demo">
            <div class="pos-box pos-relative">Relative<br></div>
        </div>

        <h3>Position Absolute (Relative to positioned parent):</h3>
        <div class="position-demo">
            <div class="pos-box pos-absolute">Absolute<br></div>
        </div>
        <!-- MEDIA QUERY SECTION -->
        <h2>3. MEDIA QUERIES</h2>

        <h3>Responsive Grid (Resize browser to see changes):</h3>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="item">Item 1</div>
            <div class="item">Item 2</div>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</html>
